      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} thanks, i genuinely had no clue about this and now this is something i wouldve been banned for furthing the statement of unknown. I will have to go through and make new versions of everything. But again a lot of people including avatar creators have no clue about this feature and that you can even veiw the texture.",
